{"title":"Ice Golem Shop","slug":"Ice_Golem_Shop","pageid":3834,"revid":19759,"timestamp":"2025-10-04T14:20:45Z","lastEditor":"May-profisinal","categories":["Locations","Stores"],"infobox":{"type":"Buildings","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Icelands (Ice Caves)"},{"label":"NPC","value":"Raffina Caldera"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.71"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"inventory","text":"Inventory"},{"id":"where-to-find-ice-cave","text":"Where To Find Ice Cave"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n\n<p><br>\nThe <b>Ice Golem Shop</b> is a store located in the bottom of the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Icelands/\">Ice Caves</a>. The store's location is pretty easy to get to but requires the use of a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flamethrower/\">Flamethrower</a>.\n</p><p>The store is located behind an ice wall that can only be destroyed by use of a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flamethrower/\">Flamethrower</a> or using 3x <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Small_Bomb/\">Small Bombs</a>. \n</p><p>The store is run by an NPC called <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Raffina_Caldera/\">Raffina Caldera</a> (A species similar to that of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lumi_Laurence/\">Lumi Laurence</a> which is a Ancient Golem)\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"inventory\">Inventory</h2>\n<p>this table shows all items available at the store.\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><b>Name</b>\n</th>\n<th><b>Picture</b>\n</th>\n<th><b>Price</b>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Icecrest_Pickaxe/\">IceCrest Pickaxe</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Icecrest Pickaxe\">Icecrest Pickaxe</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>$24,000</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Icecrest_Axe/\">IceCrest Axe</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Icecrest axe\">Icecrest axe</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>$24,000</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Celestial_Chisel/\">Celestial Chisel</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Celestialchisel\">Celestialchisel</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>$24,000</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Sled/\">Sled</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Sled\">Sled</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>$1,400</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Frozen_lantern/\">Frozen lantern</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Frozenlantern2\">Frozenlantern2</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>$500</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"where-to-find-ice-cave\">Where To Find Ice Cave</h2>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t <a href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/File:How_to_Find_the_Ice_Shop_in_Oaklands_-_With_AND_Without_Flamethrower!_(Roblox)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: How_to_Find_the_Ice_Shop_in_Oaklands_-_With_AND_Without_Flamethrower!_(Roblox)\">How_to_Find_the_Ice_Shop_in_Oaklands_-_With_AND_Without_Flamethrower!_(Roblox)</span> \t<span> \t\t<svg aria-label=\"Play\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-player-icon-play\"></use></svg>\t</span> </a>  \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>How to Find the Ice Shop in Oaklands - With AND Without Flamethrower! (Roblox)</p> \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>How to Find the Ice Shop in Oaklands - With AND Without Flamethrower! (Roblox)</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n\n</div>"}
